{"model": "Chatterbox Turbo (MLX 8-bit)", "segments": [{"text": "TL;DR: Stick to Apple’s “Basic” ads version for most scenarios.", "block": 0, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/07003310e6f37e348d10cce0957673379d815a545f2b5b4e01f9c72c7b866e2e.mp3", "words": [[1, 1.38, 1.56], [2, 1.56, 1.74], [3, 1.74, 2.12], [4, 2.12, 2.38], [5, 2.38, 2.62], [6, 2.62, 3.0], [7, 3.0, 3.24], [8, 3.24, 3.44], [9, 3.44, 3.92]]}, {"text": "Advertising a mobile app can feel overwhelming, especially for indie developers with limited budgets.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/77d17296daba29f423d8f88d1b75a21a58b4861fc30f38c03c6d2707f8e3e5d5.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.62], [1, 0.62, 0.76], [2, 0.76, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.62], [6, 1.62, 2.14], [7, 2.58, 3.02], [8, 3.02, 3.24], [9, 3.24, 3.42], [10, 3.42, 3.88], [11, 3.88, 4.18], [12, 4.18, 4.46], [13, 4.46, 4.84]]}, {"text": "With Apple offering two ad account types—Basic and Advanced—it’s tempting to believe that more control means better results.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/9cd48afcb6b0c0ae14fe837b3fb94efbc6d85ef8a14dfa5cbf79f83cf34b2549.mp3"}, {"text": "After all, who knows your app’s audience better than you?", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/02a9b85087fe700f3a53cf6527d0baa1c98f13ac282f03afecb731b602391754.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.6], [2, 0.84, 0.94], [3, 0.94, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.68], [6, 1.68, 1.98], [7, 1.98, 2.36], [8, 2.36, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.78]]}, {"text": "However, as someone who’s worked on ad optimization at Yelp, I’ve seen firsthand how trying to micromanage ad campaigns can lead to wasted money and frustration.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2bc51a2b9f0da08384d2c1210bbb33139556ec57af15e4dbea770a385e0eac7a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.44], [1, 0.74, 0.82], [2, 0.82, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.38], [4, 1.38, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.88], [6, 1.88, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.6], [8, 2.6, 3.04], [9, 3.04, 3.32], [10, 3.78, 3.96], [11, 3.96, 4.12], [12, 4.12, 4.66], [13, 4.66, 4.98], [14, 4.98, 5.34], [15, 5.34, 5.5], [16, 5.5, 6.18], [17, 6.18, 6.42], [18, 6.42, 7.02], [19, 7.02, 7.22], [20, 7.22, 7.42], [21, 7.42, 7.6], [22, 7.6, 7.94], [23, 7.94, 8.26], [24, 8.26, 8.4], [25, 8.4, 8.96]]}, {"text": "The truth is, Apple’s Basic Ads are designed to do the heavy lifting for you, delivering cost-effective results with minimal effort.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1548410efa38f037749c8b356ac940f28fba18d06745bf6adf342e5164d9e40a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.74], [3, 0.86, 1.22], [4, 1.22, 1.54], [5, 1.54, 1.86], [6, 1.86, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 2.8], [10, 2.8, 2.92], [11, 2.92, 3.18], [12, 3.18, 3.56], [13, 3.56, 3.86], [14, 3.86, 4.14], [15, 4.6, 4.92], [17, 5.64, 6.08], [18, 6.08, 6.46], [19, 6.46, 6.84], [20, 6.84, 7.28]]}, {"text": "This guide explains why starting with Basic Ads is often the smartest choice and when (if ever) you should consider upgrading to Advanced.", "block": 1, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/5bcf64867c10abfdbd238f4c428832dac929b564dd70859c29e56b2b5db48948.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.3], [4, 1.3, 1.6], [5, 1.6, 1.86], [6, 1.86, 2.1], [7, 2.1, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 2.68], [9, 2.68, 2.96], [10, 2.96, 3.1], [11, 3.1, 3.44], [12, 3.44, 3.82], [13, 3.82, 4.38], [14, 4.38, 4.6], [15, 4.8, 4.94], [16, 4.94, 5.18], [17, 5.3, 5.38], [18, 5.38, 5.54], [19, 5.54, 5.94], [20, 5.94, 6.36], [21, 6.36, 6.58], [22, 6.58, 6.92]]}, {"text": "Basic: Apple handles everything for you, optimizing for the lowest cost-per-install.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/6f625a58bd1154acc3c4effe81d8da2f19cbd49e80d9a4de30b8864dd149aee7.mp3"}, {"text": "Advanced: You gain control over keyword targeting but risk inefficiency.", "block": 2, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/21beccbc0e7e714fae6424f655635c6c563942dfd0df9bd587cbc70baf3a57c6.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.58], [1, 0.8, 0.88], [2, 0.88, 1.02], [3, 1.02, 1.36], [4, 1.36, 1.62], [6, 1.9, 2.34], [7, 2.58, 2.64], [8, 2.64, 2.88], [9, 2.88, 3.56]]}, {"text": "Apple offers two advertising account types for app developers: Basic and Advanced, each tailored to different needs.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/540222f453794f5145575934000015647d2d4b3d59d3044cd65c5672a6131a8c.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.34], [1, 0.34, 0.7], [2, 0.7, 0.96], [3, 0.96, 1.44], [4, 1.44, 1.82], [5, 1.82, 2.14], [6, 2.14, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.46], [8, 2.46, 2.98], [9, 3.26, 3.82], [10, 3.82, 4.0], [11, 4.0, 4.48], [12, 4.82, 5.04], [13, 5.04, 5.32], [14, 5.32, 5.5], [15, 5.5, 5.74], [16, 5.74, 6.06]]}, {"text": "The Basic account is built for simplicity and efficiency, with Apple managing everything from ad placement to targeting.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/41915a64f58385173b4da1d08bda56feb33b15a49e69345f6577694f4a11838b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.46], [2, 0.46, 0.84], [3, 0.84, 1.08], [4, 1.08, 1.26], [5, 1.26, 1.48], [6, 1.48, 2.04], [7, 2.04, 2.4], [8, 2.4, 2.94], [9, 3.28, 3.44], [10, 3.44, 3.66], [11, 3.66, 4.06], [12, 4.06, 4.6], [13, 4.6, 4.88], [14, 4.88, 5.08], [15, 5.08, 5.48], [16, 5.48, 5.78], [17, 5.78, 6.1]]}, {"text": "Their advanced algorithms deliver ads to users most likely to install your app, maximizing your budget with minimal effort.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/331e11db03a9686618a9961aa5eea449e19b7d49c1de536d375b20c1e63c0868.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.66], [2, 0.66, 1.18], [3, 1.18, 1.58], [4, 1.58, 1.92], [5, 1.92, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.5], [7, 2.5, 2.82], [8, 2.82, 3.24], [9, 3.24, 3.46], [10, 3.46, 3.78], [11, 3.78, 4.04], [12, 4.04, 4.34], [13, 4.74, 5.32], [14, 5.32, 5.52], [15, 5.52, 5.84], [16, 5.84, 6.06], [17, 6.06, 6.3], [18, 6.3, 6.74]]}, {"text": "This hands-off approach is ideal for indie developers or newcomers to app advertising, as it focuses entirely on cost-per-install efficiency.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e1a6cc07ce647a36c0a21c215f60d1c117cdc3192c54faa825604c3ef69eaa70.mp3"}, {"text": "Simply set your budget, and Apple handles the rest.", "block": 3, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/73011181a04df9ec1aaeb6110b365dea4be7e12c51dd57324526c9832e0f8f0d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.4], [1, 0.4, 0.6], [2, 0.6, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.36], [5, 1.36, 1.64], [6, 1.64, 1.96], [7, 1.96, 2.16], [8, 2.16, 2.34]]}, {"text": "In contrast, the Advanced account provides more control but introduces complexity and risk.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/32747aee70fcb62a6ec1fc73cda4022c7508a891ae73f24bcce9446b61b1fdf2.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.74], [2, 1.1, 1.2], [4, 1.46, 1.9], [5, 1.9, 2.26], [6, 2.26, 2.58], [7, 2.58, 3.0], [8, 3.46, 3.52], [9, 3.52, 4.04], [10, 4.04, 4.64], [11, 4.64, 4.98], [12, 4.98, 5.36]]}, {"text": "It lets you target specific keywords, define audience demographics, and set manual bids for placements.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/7610f9d043a35ef23c47cb8bc61df4ca5ad32974335a58f784ea42a32b3e1a07.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.14], [1, 0.14, 0.32], [2, 0.32, 0.44], [3, 0.44, 0.68], [4, 0.68, 1.14], [5, 1.14, 1.62], [6, 2.2, 2.44], [7, 2.44, 2.82], [8, 2.82, 3.42], [9, 4.0, 4.12], [10, 4.12, 4.32], [11, 4.32, 4.66], [13, 4.92, 5.08], [14, 5.08, 5.62]]}, {"text": "This customization is valuable for niche apps or products with unique targeting needs.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c791ba2677a5e1066d28f0f4fccc2ea4a81f29265979364e2bc4b407ea58f55c.mp3", "words": [[2, 0.98, 1.26], [3, 1.26, 1.66], [4, 1.66, 1.98], [5, 1.98, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.54], [7, 2.54, 2.76], [8, 2.76, 3.14], [9, 3.14, 3.5], [10, 3.5, 3.94], [11, 3.94, 4.4], [12, 4.4, 4.8]]}, {"text": "However, it demands expertise and constant monitoring to avoid costly inefficiencies.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/e39e866fd60e803f41b6eb0857e90d0cf773efa00155a131fdd72a39891f2af1.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.66, 0.74], [2, 0.74, 0.98], [3, 0.98, 1.56], [4, 1.56, 1.82], [5, 1.82, 2.18], [6, 2.18, 2.54], [7, 2.54, 2.94], [8, 2.94, 3.16], [9, 3.16, 3.6], [10, 3.6, 4.38]]}, {"text": "Poorly optimized campaigns can quickly burn through your budget, making Advanced accounts risky for those without a clear strategy.", "block": 4, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/3b3a16046e42d2df67d85763a105ad2bd40a442d1c9929ba26ae32601820bb9a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.38], [1, 0.38, 0.92], [2, 0.92, 1.46], [3, 1.46, 1.94], [4, 1.94, 2.32], [5, 2.32, 2.56], [6, 2.56, 2.78], [7, 2.78, 2.92], [8, 2.92, 3.28], [9, 3.74, 4.0], [10, 4.0, 4.5], [11, 4.5, 4.78], [12, 4.78, 5.3], [13, 5.3, 5.56], [14, 5.56, 5.76], [15, 5.76, 6.08], [16, 6.08, 6.24], [17, 6.24, 6.42], [18, 6.42, 6.94]]}, {"text": "Apple’s Basic Ads outperform Advanced Ads for most indie developers by leveraging Apple’s unmatched optimization capabilities.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/d724ace9cc963e59fbeb22cf599003dbb922ea7393d7a884d4f4562f39e4c15d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.46], [1, 0.46, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.1], [3, 1.1, 1.74], [4, 1.74, 2.06], [5, 2.06, 2.5], [6, 2.5, 2.72], [7, 2.72, 3.0], [8, 3.0, 3.24], [9, 3.24, 3.72], [10, 3.72, 4.04], [11, 4.04, 4.44], [12, 4.44, 5.08], [13, 5.08, 5.52], [14, 5.52, 6.14], [15, 6.14, 6.86]]}, {"text": "Instead of micromanaging keywords or bids, Basic Ads automate the process to find users most likely to install your app at the lowest cost.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c1fbd1a4823fe49041a0bb667bc0b54df1bf3abb5ba55e8cfe2f017045707a70.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.36], [1, 0.36, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 1.16], [3, 1.16, 1.68], [4, 1.68, 2.1], [5, 2.1, 2.6], [6, 3.1, 3.3], [7, 3.3, 3.54], [8, 3.54, 4.0], [9, 4.0, 4.18], [10, 4.18, 4.54], [11, 4.54, 4.8], [12, 4.8, 5.02], [13, 5.02, 5.38], [14, 5.38, 5.66], [15, 5.66, 6.04], [16, 6.04, 6.2], [17, 6.2, 6.5], [18, 6.5, 6.76], [19, 6.76, 6.92], [20, 6.92, 7.08], [21, 7.08, 7.18], [22, 7.18, 7.4], [23, 7.4, 7.8]]}, {"text": "Apple’s vested interest in your success ensures their ads prioritize cost-effective results.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/b84afb24a3fcfec3662f30ac17e034db55333379910008a1701d71356874e20d.mp3"}, {"text": "By minimizing your workload and costs, Basic Ads offer a reliable way to grow your app without requiring deep marketing expertise.", "block": 5, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/bcd254ba80122bc492d06c7a01069a32090bfb961607bb7e0bb9ef780eedadbf.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.16], [1, 0.16, 0.5], [2, 0.5, 0.88], [3, 0.88, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.42], [5, 1.42, 1.92], [6, 2.14, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.58], [8, 2.58, 3.0], [9, 3.0, 3.2], [10, 3.2, 3.46], [11, 3.46, 3.8], [12, 3.8, 3.96], [13, 3.96, 4.16], [14, 4.16, 4.38], [15, 4.38, 4.56], [16, 4.56, 4.9], [17, 4.9, 5.48], [18, 5.48, 5.8], [19, 5.8, 6.2], [20, 6.2, 6.8]]}, {"text": "Advanced Ads may be worth considering in specific cases where Basic Ads fail to reach key audiences.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/51ac7e063951c74163e5f5a11a7d66a164a13c2838a024456de7bfd12f6e3370.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.5], [1, 0.5, 0.78], [2, 0.78, 1.06], [3, 1.06, 1.2], [4, 1.2, 1.44], [5, 1.44, 1.94], [6, 1.94, 2.14], [7, 2.14, 2.52], [8, 2.52, 3.04], [9, 3.04, 3.36], [10, 3.36, 3.68], [11, 3.68, 4.04], [12, 4.04, 4.3], [13, 4.3, 4.52], [14, 4.52, 4.78], [15, 4.78, 5.06], [16, 5.06, 5.62]]}, {"text": "If your app serves a niche market or requires a particular demographic for success, Advanced Ads allow you to fine-tune targeting and allocate budgets toward high-value users.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/beb617d97e1f4437f3e9f05cbe84038ce57ffda9ad3a3eaf3e8a453c7c7db66d.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.38], [2, 0.38, 0.58], [3, 0.58, 0.96], [4, 0.96, 1.12], [5, 1.12, 1.34], [6, 1.34, 1.7], [7, 1.7, 1.98], [8, 1.98, 2.46], [9, 2.46, 2.7], [10, 2.7, 3.18], [11, 3.18, 3.78], [12, 3.78, 4.04], [13, 4.04, 4.6], [15, 5.46, 5.72], [16, 5.72, 6.06], [17, 6.06, 6.26], [18, 6.26, 6.4], [20, 7.0, 7.5], [21, 7.5, 7.78], [22, 7.78, 8.14], [23, 8.14, 8.54], [24, 8.54, 8.88], [26, 9.46, 9.8]]}, {"text": "However, transitioning to Advanced Ads requires data from Basic Ads to understand user behavior and cost-per-install trends.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/fa51d34602ea1fc695028a57ea9e034b3b446688b303180ff20e5b4af5925ee4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.48], [1, 0.94, 1.34], [2, 1.34, 1.7], [3, 1.7, 1.98], [4, 1.98, 2.42], [5, 2.42, 2.84], [6, 2.84, 3.28], [7, 3.28, 3.5], [8, 3.5, 3.82], [9, 3.82, 4.18], [10, 4.18, 4.4], [11, 4.4, 4.86], [12, 4.86, 5.14], [13, 5.14, 5.64], [14, 5.64, 5.92], [16, 6.76, 7.18]]}, {"text": "Without this foundation, you risk inefficiency and wasted resources.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/eecf33e7eb2f9b900de284a895e3cfb6b502919610c3454c5419eef1f110db3b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.3], [1, 0.3, 0.52], [2, 0.52, 1.08], [3, 1.28, 1.34], [4, 1.34, 1.48], [5, 1.48, 2.24], [6, 2.24, 2.5], [7, 2.5, 2.82], [8, 2.82, 3.36]]}, {"text": "If you choose Advanced Ads, start with a small test budget and refine your strategy gradually.", "block": 6, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/1ec398544ade89068c4d91c92d2413d561e3867755f51da2cea2e707a893be39.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.36], [2, 0.36, 0.56], [4, 0.96, 1.48], [5, 1.78, 2.0], [6, 2.0, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.28], [8, 2.28, 2.58], [9, 2.58, 2.92], [10, 2.92, 3.34], [11, 3.34, 3.68], [12, 3.68, 4.02], [13, 4.02, 4.24], [14, 4.24, 4.72], [15, 4.72, 5.28]]}, {"text": "For indie developers, Apple’s Basic Ads offer a perfect balance of simplicity, efficiency, and effectiveness.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/2219f3024363bfa755f7ab49d93cdb9fb977369978826c4119654447541cf815.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.24], [1, 0.24, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 1.0], [3, 1.28, 1.66], [4, 1.66, 1.96], [5, 1.96, 2.26], [6, 2.26, 2.68], [7, 2.68, 2.88], [8, 2.88, 3.24], [9, 3.24, 3.66], [10, 3.66, 3.88], [11, 3.88, 4.4], [12, 4.64, 4.94], [13, 5.28, 5.36], [14, 5.36, 5.82]]}, {"text": "They free you from the complexities of manual targeting and ensure optimal ad spend.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c243b1977f2384a74cd575c76c948c2c499b42e6a5a5031affebe5c1658e800c.mp3"}, {"text": "While Advanced Ads provide more control, their risks and required expertise often outweigh their benefits.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/c34ba43ac825491144babebca5eb54f767d434847a02b3af83d4f7e14e9346b4.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.56], [2, 0.56, 0.78], [3, 0.78, 1.14], [4, 1.14, 1.38], [5, 1.38, 1.82], [6, 2.24, 2.34], [7, 2.34, 2.68], [8, 2.68, 2.92], [9, 2.92, 3.38], [10, 3.38, 3.98], [11, 3.98, 4.42], [12, 4.42, 4.72], [13, 4.72, 4.9], [14, 4.9, 5.28]]}, {"text": "By starting with Basic Ads, you can collect valuable insights, optimize your campaigns, and scale your user base without unnecessary stress or expense.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/51f73d77b8223c8873085cc24c8cb5bd70348bf86d6072767d6adfaef54e125a.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.18], [1, 0.18, 0.48], [2, 0.48, 0.74], [3, 0.74, 1.04], [4, 1.04, 1.56], [5, 1.96, 2.02], [6, 2.02, 2.16], [7, 2.16, 2.44], [8, 2.44, 2.92], [9, 2.92, 3.52], [10, 3.98, 4.32], [11, 4.32, 4.58], [12, 4.58, 5.0], [13, 5.4, 5.62], [14, 5.62, 5.88], [15, 5.88, 6.1], [16, 6.1, 6.34], [17, 6.34, 6.6], [18, 6.6, 6.98], [19, 6.98, 7.62], [20, 7.62, 8.22], [21, 8.22, 8.5], [22, 8.5, 8.84]]}, {"text": "Keep it simple, trust Apple’s optimization, and focus on growing your app efficiently.", "block": 7, "audio": "../../../assets/blog-audio/56878433cc6338cc764f9b12647b5bac01313327f6b69ca051da90d559b8d33b.mp3", "words": [[0, 0.0, 0.26], [1, 0.26, 0.4], [2, 0.4, 0.8], [3, 1.12, 1.44], [5, 1.74, 2.38], [6, 3.0, 3.2], [7, 3.2, 3.46], [8, 3.46, 3.72], [10, 3.92, 4.2], [11, 4.2, 4.4], [12, 4.4, 4.84]]}]}